  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Financial support towards the development of a twinning covenant for EU/Phare project LV00/IB/JH-01, Development of Integrated Latvian Border Management Strategy for Latvia. The implementation of the project is jointly undertaken by Migrationsverket. Sweden is junior partner with Finland as lead.</narrative>
   <narrative xml:lang="SV">Finansiering f&#xf6;r utarbetande av s.k. twinning covenant f&#xf6;r EU-Phare twinning-projekt LV00/IB/JH-01, Development of Integrated Latvian Border Management Strategy f&#xf6;r Lettland. Projektet genomf&#xf6;rs tillsamman med Migrationsverket. Sverige &#xe4;r junior partner med Finaland som huvudansvarig.</narrative>
  </description>
